messages.content:
Create a JSON file in bin/Data/DrivenKeys/:
{
  "name": "my_curve_set",
  "keys": [{
    "name": "param_to_output",
    "driverParam": "inputName",
    "drivenParam": "outputName",
    "mode": "smooth",
    "points": [
      {"in": 0.0, "out": 0.0},
      {"in": 0.5, "out": 1.0},
      {"in": 1.0, "out": 0.5}
    ]
  }]
}
Modes: linear, smooth, step, catmullrom.
Load: cache->GetResource<JSONFile>("DrivenKeys/my_curve_set.json")
Parse: DrivenKeySet set; set.LoadJSON(json->GetRoot())
Evaluate: float result = set.keys[0].Evaluate(inputValue)

Node* boneNode = skeleton.GetBone("hand_r").node_;
Node* attachNode = boneNode->CreateChild("_Equip");
auto* model = attachNode->CreateComponent<StaticModel>();
model->SetModel(cache->GetResource<Model>(itemInfo.model));
attachNode->SetPosition(offset); // from ModelTool tuning
attachNode->SetRotation(rotation);
attachNode->SetScale(scale);

To detach: attachNode->Remove();
Driven by animation text keys: key fires event, handler attaches/detaches.
